OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F371A1790156891
OL,3,CParalympic gold medallist calls for
OL,4,Cremoval of VAT on tandem bicycles for
OL,5,Cblind
OL,7,FA Paralympic gold medallist is calling
OL,8,Ffor the Treasury to remove VAT from
OL,9,Ftandem bicycles to help blind and
OL,10,Fvisually impaired people get into
OL,11,Fcycling.
OL,13,FLizzi Jordan, who won a gold medal in
OL,14,Fthe time trial at the Paris games in
OL,15,F2024, said removing the tax could
OL,16,Fallow more people with visual
OL,17,Fdisabilities get out and about on two
OL,18,Fwheels, which could mean huge benefits
OL,19,Fto their health and wellbeing.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBLondon SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,372,400,250,120,000,100
PN,37102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F371A1790156891
OL,3,CParalympic gold medallist calls for
OL,4,Cremoval of VAT on tandem bicycles for
OL,5,Cblind
OL,7,FCurrently, tandem bikes are subject to
OL,8,Fthe 20% tax. However, bicycles that
OL,9,Fare adapted for other disabilities,
OL,10,Fsuch as hand cycles for amputees, are
OL,11,FVAT-exempt. Ms Jordan believes two-
OL,12,Fperson bicycles should be brought into
OL,13,Fline for people with visually impaired
OL,14,Fpeople.
OL,16,FThe 28-year-old, who is a six-time
OL,17,Fworld champion and was made an MBE in
OL,18,F2025 for services to cycling, compared
OL,19,Fthe situation to a "disability
OL,20,Flottery".
OL,26,@{D@TOU|D@HO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBLondon SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,372,400,250,120,000,100
PN,37103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F371A1790156891
OL,3,CParalympic gold medallist calls for
OL,4,Cremoval of VAT on tandem bicycles for
OL,5,Cblind
OL,7,FThe Treasury said it already offers
OL,8,Fsome support to blind people, but
OL,9,Fadded it would not comment on
OL,10,Fspeculation.
OL,12,FMs Jordan, from Guildford in Surrey,
OL,13,Fhas written to John Healey ahead of
OL,14,Fthe Budget on October 28.
OL,16,FShe said: "It does frustrate me
OL,17,Fbecause it's not just hard having a
OL,18,Fdisability, but it's even harder to
OL,19,Fsee some disabilities have been
OL,20,Fawarded with incentives and tax
OL,21,Freliefs, and others haven't.
OL,26,@xD@KOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBLondon SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,372,400,250,120,000,100
PN,37104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F371A1790156891
OL,3,CParalympic gold medallist calls for
OL,4,Cremoval of VAT on tandem bicycles for
OL,5,Cblind
OL,7,F"It shouldn't depend what disability
OL,8,Fyou have as to whether you get the VAT
OL,9,Fexemption, because disabled people
OL,10,Falready earn so much less, and already
OL,11,Fare discriminated against in so many
OL,12,Fways in society.
OL,14,F"So I can't understand how we're going
OL,15,Feven further into that discrimination
OL,16,Fand now discriminating against what
OL,17,Fdisability you have as to whether you
OL,18,Fcan access a bike."
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOUzD@SO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBLondon SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,372,400,250,120,000,100
PN,37105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F371A1790156891
OL,3,CParalympic gold medallist calls for
OL,4,Cremoval of VAT on tandem bicycles for
OL,5,Cblind
OL,7,FShe added: "I'm not trying to reinvent
OL,8,Fthe wheel here. This exists already.
OL,9,FTandems just need to be included in it.
OL,11,F"It's not like I'm trying to ask the
OL,12,FGovernment to do something totally
OL,13,Funique and extreme. This system
OL,14,Falready exists. It just discriminates
OL,15,Fagainst visually impaired people."
OL,26,@oD@LOUsD@AOUwD@bO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBLondon SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,372,400,250,120,000,100
PN,37106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F371A1790156891
OL,3,CParalympic gold medallist calls for
OL,4,Cremoval of VAT on tandem bicycles for
OL,5,Cblind
OL,7,FMs Jordan lost her sight after
OL,8,Fcontracting E-coli as a student, aged
OL,9,F19 in 2017. She spent eight weeks in a
OL,10,Fcoma in multi-organ failure, and was
OL,11,Fin hospital for 12 weeks. She had to
OL,12,Flearn to walk again, but just over a
OL,13,Fyear later ran the London Marathon,
OL,14,Fraising #15,000 for the Royal National
OL,15,FInstitute for Blind People.
OL,17,FShe then attended a talent
OL,18,Fidentification day for British Cycling
OL,19,Fin 2020 and began training as an
OL,20,Fathlete.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBLondon SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,372,400,250,120,000,100
PN,37107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F371A1790156891
OL,3,CParalympic gold medallist calls for
OL,4,Cremoval of VAT on tandem bicycles for
OL,5,Cblind
OL,7,F"I thought I want to achieve more
OL,8,Fwithout my sight than I ever even
OL,9,Fwould with it," she said.
OL,11,FHowever, she believes the VAT costs on
OL,12,Fbikes could put off both the next
OL,13,Fgeneration of para-athletes, and
OL,14,Fpeople cycling for their own enjoyment.
OL,16,FMs Jordan competes on a tandem with a
OL,17,F"pilot" who directs the bicycle as she
OL,18,Fpedals. She won her 2024 Paris medal
OL,19,Falongside Danni Khan.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@OO]yD@AOUyD@GO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBLondon SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,372,400,250,120,000,100
PN,37108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F371A1790156891
OL,3,CParalympic gold medallist calls for
OL,4,Cremoval of VAT on tandem bicycles for
OL,5,Cblind
OL,7,FThe adapted bicycles receive a tax
OL,8,Fexemption as they are designed and
OL,9,Fproduced solely for disabled people.
OL,10,FHowever, the tandems blind people can
OL,11,Fuse are the same as for able-bodied
OL,12,Fpeople, so have not got the same
OL,13,Frelief. They can cost between #1,000
OL,14,Fand #2,500.
OL,16,FAccording to its research, British
OL,17,FCycling believes it would cost the
OL,18,FTreasury #27,000 for the VAT cut.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBLondon SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,372,400,250,120,000,100
PN,37109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F371A1790156891
OL,3,CParalympic gold medallist calls for
OL,4,Cremoval of VAT on tandem bicycles for
OL,5,Cblind
OL,7,FMs Jordan said she believes people who
OL,8,Fhave got the NHS's CV1 certification
OL,9,Fof blindness should be able to qualify
OL,10,Ffor the discount.
OL,12,FShe said she feels a "moral duty" to
OL,13,Fcampaign on the issue: "When I started
OL,14,Fcycling, my parents funded me a
OL,15,Ftandem, which again I was fortunate
OL,16,Fthey were in the financial position to
OL,17,Fdo so.
OL,26,@tD@VOUtD@aO]uD@XOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/13
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/R(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBLondon SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,372,400,250,120,000,100
PN,37110
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F371A1790156891
OL,3,CParalympic gold medallist calls for
OL,4,Cremoval of VAT on tandem bicycles for
OL,5,Cblind
OL,7,F"But tandems are more expensive than
OL,8,Fyour standard bike that your normal
OL,9,Fcyclists could pick up from Evans, and
OL,10,Fthey are inflated because they're a
OL,11,Fdifferent kind of bike.
OL,13,F"There's not that many of them
OL,14,Fproduced, and obviously specialist
OL,15,Fequipment."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUwD@KO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G10/13
