OL,24,ANext PageBLondon SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,372,400,250,120,000,100
PN,37111
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F371A1790156891
OL,3,CParalympic gold medallist calls for
OL,4,Cremoval of VAT on tandem bicycles for
OL,5,Cblind
OL,7,FShe added: "Not everyone wants to
OL,8,Fbecome an elite tandem cyclist when
OL,9,Fthey get into cycling, but everyone
OL,10,Fshould have the right to cycling and
OL,11,Fto enjoy all the other benefits it can
OL,12,Fgive you."
OL,14,FA Treasury spokesperson said blind
OL,15,Fpeople already qualify for a #3,250
OL,16,Fhigher rate of personal allowance.
OL,26,@oD@LOUtD@JO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G11/13
