FL,372,400,250,120,000,100
PN,37112
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F371A1790156891
OL,3,CParalympic gold medallist calls for
OL,4,Cremoval of VAT on tandem bicycles for
OL,5,Cblind
OL,7,FThey said: "We want to ensure the tax
OL,8,Fsystem is fair for blind and visually
OL,9,Fimpaired people, which is why support
OL,10,Fis already available through measures
OL,11,Fsuch as the Blind Person's Allowance
OL,12,Fand a range of VAT reliefs.
OL,14,F"As has always been the case,
OL,15,Fdecisions on tax are a matter for the
OL,16,FChancellor to set out at fiscal
OL,17,Fevents, and we do not comment on
OL,18,Fspeculation or proposals ahead of the
OL,19,FBudget."
OL,26,@oD@LOUvD@AOU{D@HO]
